{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_058_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_058_title", "source_sha256": "ff9507e204a6beaa6a476e9b4997aeacfbc35225384514a545de9b9b77dc7411", "ja": "上手じゃないし、笑われちゃうけど", "zh": "虽然水平不高，也会被大家笑话，但是", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_058_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_058_synopsis", "source_sha256": "c4ffb79176e3e518988099c0f06c1be7f8faad7634c8e6135897676ba3831f19", "ja": "新曲披露に向けてのランニング中、可奈は\n泣いている男の子と出会う。歌で元気付けた\nものの、まだまだへたっぴ？と凹む可奈に、\n仲間達は「可奈の歌が好きだ」と告げる。\nそして公演当日、会場中に歌が響き渡る…。", "zh": "在为了发表新曲而跑步锻炼的途中，可奈\n遇到了一个正在哭泣的男孩子。虽然用歌声\n让他打起了精神，可奈还是因觉得自己水平不够\n而感到失落。这时同伴们对她说“我们喜欢可奈的歌声”。\n终于到了公演当天，歌声响彻了整个会场……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_058_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_058_1000_p", "source_sha256": "b63b238e19ee40def2d36f0b2e992fb2e61aa96105760cdc6e96386c6e1617e6", "ja": "（次の公演は、可奈の新曲披露がある。\n今日は出演メンバーが揃っての全体練習だ）", "zh": "（下一场公演将有可奈的新曲首次披露。\n今天是全体演出成员到齐后的集体练习）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_058_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_058_1001_p", "source_sha256": "cff9d5ceb732c9ca4e467eeff7c125b008f4d1e04d6036f01d088b61a5b76acb", "ja": "みんな、お疲れさま！\nうん、ちゃんと揃ってるみたいだな。", "zh": "大家辛苦了！\n嗯，看来人都到齐了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_058_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_058_1002_036kan", "source_sha256": "d71ac305c4e9487027314263374bf5f4dc549f9ad0c2fe230e10af592cc72e4c", "ja": "はーい♪", "zh": "好──♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_058_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_058_1003_033sih", "source_sha256": "2910a18eec8fd2dd5cd180079f7daaa70fc264fbed0798ef916403245c1c3d55", "ja": "はい。", "zh": "是的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_058_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_058_1004_027say", "source_sha256": "b96bdef1da1baed37785b5d34cd69d3ebf0727a310e843be161a905b96889201", "ja": "はいっ！", "zh": "是！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_058_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_058_1005_029umi", "source_sha256": "2b2d0c9726c62d4794e4484bae319b59c94619fd2d27ffbee8c5119d8b3b601a", "ja": "はーい！", "zh": "是──！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_058_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_058_1006_022ser", "source_sha256": "9bee1fe06cb5231d6fb5fa2ee7d4af79926b7a1bf612297e254e51acd62885ae", "ja": "はい♪", "zh": "好的♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_058_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_058_1007_p", "source_sha256": "93c002d7bb5529abe66f224bae5a48a73992f9641d69fcfbfd1c0f49687c8b66", "ja": "それじゃ、早速始めよう。今日の基礎メニューは、\nランニングだな。コースはいつもどおり、劇場周辺！", "zh": "那么，马上开始吧。今天的基础训练项目是——\n跑步。路线和往常一样，就在剧场周边！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_058_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_058_1008_029umi", "source_sha256": "b9225957eb50b780f844eea3865c2d08a3583d390cc39220fe448f9ec4fa0b35", "ja": "ランニングなら、まかせてっ！\nいきなりの……うみみんダーッシュ☆", "zh": "要是跑步的话，就交给我吧！\n突然来个……海美冲刺☆", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_058_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_058_1009_027say", "source_sha256": "72a23f608347fe93c091ccf30cc42b76c92ecb1fb3c5cad13e9a70a369fb8407", "ja": "わっ！？　海美、もうあんな遠くまで……。\nよーし、私だって！", "zh": "哇！？海美，都跑那么远了……\n好～，我也不会认输的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_058_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_058_1010_022ser", "source_sha256": "82ee5edd721961abe0d550e107bdb0f52b5899fc0121f679eb1f99db649fa6bd", "ja": "あっ、海美さん、紗代子さん……行っちゃいました。\n志保さん、可奈さん。わたしたちも追いかけましょう！", "zh": "啊，海美小姐、纱代子小姐……已经走掉了。\n志保小姐、可奈小姐，我们也追上去吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_058_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_058_1011_033sih", "source_sha256": "2c0fa2dc74d70da5cbc88c2fa0f542e7c9a2b1e03980fc47443eb7b90352ea1a", "ja": "ええ、そうね。それじゃ、\n{$P$}さん、いってきます。", "zh": "嗯，是啊。那么，{$P$}先生，我们出发了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_058_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_058_1012_p", "source_sha256": "ec7c2dfb3f8041415cba1d67a31f1cc8d13a7de878782474435571e0dcc2c146", "ja": "みんな、最初からあまり飛ばし過ぎるなよ！\n自分のペースを守るように！", "zh": "大家，别一开始就冲得太猛啊！\n要保持自己的节奏！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_058_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_058_1013_036kan", "source_sha256": "d2a4356c7e5383b51a0aaa2a8c19259f44c3289e618ccbcce2b70db8bbad9a19", "ja": "わわっ！？　志保ちゃん、星梨花ちゃん、待って～！\nあっ、くつひもが解けちゃった！", "zh": "哇哇！？志保，星梨花，等等我～！\n啊，鞋带散开了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_058_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_058_1014_p", "source_sha256": "fcdf370d03fcc9ece42788b6010871b90bb73a31d3681db279ca9ba4adc435d7", "ja": "可奈、大丈夫だ。待ってるから、\n慌てないでちゃんと靴紐を結ぼう。", "zh": "可奈，没事的。我会等着你，别慌，好好把鞋带系上。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_058_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_058_1015_036kan", "source_sha256": "0d7de90828324cd765b8355f4d60762870042ee01965f5f264816953914a62b3", "ja": "うう、{$P$}さん……\nわかりました。", "zh": "呜呜，{$P$}先生……\n我知道了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_058_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_058_1017_p", "source_sha256": "bdb84c308004b3c102fbff7111509258ef28dc20206fb9fa47c1fe3ecc4ea251", "ja": "（海美と紗代子は、あっという間に見えなくなって\nしまった。星梨花と志保も……）", "zh": "（海美和纱代子转眼间就跑得没影了。星梨花和志保也……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_058_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_058_1018_p", "source_sha256": "b6cb50e7a4f8225e505eb5f5200b7a5246050338d5656317b453c969b2843f76", "ja": "これは、流石に追いつけそうにないな……。", "zh": "这下看来，实在是追不上了……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_058_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_058_1019_036kan", "source_sha256": "98ae74f8965668cc4c04d3e1f162692d5bd7ea39cdba17bd6edade1c9e02f9e1", "ja": "うう、海美ちゃんと紗代子さんにおいていかれた～♪\n星梨花ちゃんと志保ちゃんにも、おいていかれた～♪", "zh": "呜呜，被海美和纱代子小姐甩在身后了～♪\n也被星梨花和志保甩在身后了～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_058_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_058_1020_036kan", "source_sha256": "ddce3f998c6a70b03f880e94dcf46844e80b7a352e05cf0f52e5991f5984578d", "ja": "でもでも、{$P$}さんが一緒で\nよかったな～。まだまだ行けそう、がんばれそう～♪", "zh": "不过不过，能和{$P$}先生一起真是太好了～感觉还可以继续前进，还能继续加油～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_058_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_058_1021_036kan", "source_sha256": "9830328c9b0b6e8827c87d0ee526aeb8268e41a95ac437040aef741dc41747a2", "ja": "あれ？", "zh": "那个？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_058_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_058_1022_p", "source_sha256": "d9bfc8ebfd5413d190309d181c03d9fa511033b318c7001f3b811933c04327f9", "ja": "どうした？　可奈。", "zh": "怎么了？可奈。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_058_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_058_1023_036kan", "source_sha256": "608dbcf389175daf20b803fbf8f06a50eb5175716ebfea7823565ef7e7259637", "ja": "あそこ……小さい子がいる。\nあんなところにひとりで、どうしたんだろう？", "zh": "那边……有个小孩子。\n一个人在那种地方，也不知道是怎么了？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_058_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_058_1024_p", "source_sha256": "e6237b3fca3ba730b2ba62fed1e09f1deac65aa5ef8240604084067d789487ec", "ja": "ん？　本当だ……男の子だな。\n泣いているようにも見えるけど……。", "zh": "嗯？真的……是个男孩子啊。\n看起来好像在哭……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_058_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_058_1025_chiisaiotokonoko", "source_sha256": "fbd3ade6c690064f07fcdb44181b37460c1548b667adb9df561b1a9164ae7691", "ja": "うう、ぐす……。", "zh": "呜呜，抽泣……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_058_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_058_1027_p", "source_sha256": "6e4f9ef775484fccbf03da94cf3f37594a3571429def35297ec9cfffac4dc1c8", "ja": "もしかして迷子かな？\nだとしたら、保護者を探さないと……。", "zh": "难道是迷路了吗？\n要是这样的话，得找找监护人才行……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_058_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_058_1028_chiisaiotokonoko", "source_sha256": "12c9a0b8406266aee93bcc66daeb78c6f2c35f3ec8c9a1e63fd1d3366c072883", "ja": "まいごじゃない……\nぼく……れんしゅう、してた……。", "zh": "我才不是迷路了……\n我……一直在练习……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_058_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_058_1026_036kan", "source_sha256": "a005ee7336f9a2e224b3d446eff13987bc403ae760368753838987efaf0b6a1c", "ja": "ぼく、どうしたの？", "zh": "我怎么了？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_058_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_058_1029_036kan", "source_sha256": "927920133c990652bfd289387d926488914eba48369e79d7f785e7d72da7fdb5", "ja": "れんしゅう？\n練習って、何の練習？", "zh": "练习？\n练习是指，什么练习呀？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_058_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_058_1030_022ser", "source_sha256": "f3f0399eba5db3d177954dc9f05213f510b86c3ac1a23773574a97240a046797", "ja": "可奈さん、{$P$}さん！\nどうかしたんですか？", "zh": "可奈，{$P$}先生！\n怎么了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_058_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_058_1031_036kan", "source_sha256": "70a12690aad0c3d6d497bbeee3a17dc9c01c12cc03333ae3d38678e350236325", "ja": "あっ、星梨花ちゃん、志保ちゃん！\n戻ってきてくれたの？", "zh": "啊，星梨花、小志保！\n你们回来啦？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_058_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_058_1032_033sih", "source_sha256": "3e331aff5aea5f3005dac8953d93e8d2a14cdd8fee808f7fec9aad0c483cb322", "ja": "あんまり遅いから、迎えに来たのよ。\n何かあったの？　……この子は？", "zh": "因为你们回来得太晚了，我就来接你们了。\n出什么事了吗？……这孩子是？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_058_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_058_1034_029umi", "source_sha256": "32d53b2809d8f424c5005a757dd8f00640e19fec4bc03d5943ba7a997ad750be", "ja": "みんな、どうしたのー？\n全然追いついて来ないから、戻ってきたんだけど。", "zh": "大家怎么了～？\n看你们完全没跟上来，我就折回来了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_058_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_058_1035_027say", "source_sha256": "efe0a523e19f0af9d90cee5de6f5ff4578e07feb17ae44a67e475d50cf7f25c5", "ja": "あれ、その子……\n{$P$}、どうしたんですか？", "zh": "咦，那个孩子……\n{$P$}，你怎么了？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_058_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_058_1036_p", "source_sha256": "ffed70c6505d8459dfcfa9be1ebc2bdee2328b8fb638922cf5720da0a1fd1dc5", "ja": "ああ、泣いてるのを可奈が見つけて、気になったから\nちょっと事情を聞こうと思って。", "zh": "是可奈发现这孩子在哭，觉得有些在意，所以想稍微问问情况。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_058_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_058_1037_036kan", "source_sha256": "60c3d3773e0dc54a40c8fcd7e8f93309c909f6d9e24774673abcc67b67200942", "ja": "ねえ、ぼく。よかったら、\nお姉さんにお話してくれないかな？", "zh": "小朋友，如果你愿意的话，可以跟姐姐说说吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_058_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_058_1038_chiisaiotokonoko", "source_sha256": "de83dd802f1f9e44afb45cd2e52314aca66b5faede45699804c76c5890166d39", "ja": "……ようちえんの、おうたのとき……\nこえがちいさいって、わらわれて……。それで……。", "zh": "……在幼儿园……唱歌的时候……\n被笑话声音太小了……然后就……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_058_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_058_1039_036kan", "source_sha256": "dc9eb70143d6d60a9bc977d37203a15cf18ade66772b2e51fbea9832d05edf25", "ja": "そっか。ここで、歌の練習をしてたんだね！", "zh": "这样啊。你之前是在这里练歌的呀！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_058_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_058_1040_036kan", "source_sha256": "a1191e2783be3413501597f9ef1affe5ab2e7d3b795d5cf8755b246f7f500f4f", "ja": "でも、声が小さいだけなら簡単だよ！\n声を大きく出せばいいんだもん♪", "zh": "不过，如果只是声音太小的话，很简单呀！\n只要把声音放大就好了嘛♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_058_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_058_1041_033sih", "source_sha256": "3116b561a37a65182f0de3f9ac26a653a82462ae34203aa25c083368b51a7be0", "ja": "それはそうだろうけど……。この子は\nそれができないから、練習してるんじゃないの？", "zh": "话是这么说没错……可这孩子正因为做不到，才在练习吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_058_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_058_1042_036kan", "source_sha256": "d3bf744354b7d308c99ab46bacf6917b3e7d1d8cadd5a8f3f508091d26b4efad", "ja": "はっ、そっか！　……はれ？\nでも声を大きくするって、どうすればいいんだろ？", "zh": "啊，原来如此！……咦？\n可是，要怎么才能把声音放大呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_058_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_058_1043_022ser", "source_sha256": "625ee6e50738293a3f03459dd0b98730d53421a78e8a049f38a54d38084d077b", "ja": "可奈さんは、どうやって大きな声が出せるように\nなったんですか？", "zh": "可奈姐，你是怎么练到能发出这么大声音的？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_058_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_058_1044_036kan", "source_sha256": "1d2e2f00e1b49d72fa894c81471ab5576a045c34d785172abf66a4d8136c4211", "ja": "私？　私は、えっとー……。\nあれ？　どうやってだろ……。", "zh": "我？我嘛，呃——……\n咦？到底是怎么做到的来着……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_058_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_058_1045_027say", "source_sha256": "2c32d2f545a5ec196d21333c3ef8b4527e3f9b19c4fb2bf20ab24c5c0deda277", "ja": "大きな声が出せるように……\nやっぱり、少しずつ練習するしかないのかな？", "zh": "为了能发出大声……\n果然只能一点一点地练习了吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_058_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_058_1046_029umi", "source_sha256": "467787fbcac63d73ad45519971afbe42f6f42aa8b2ee5f36a449ad76f44545d9", "ja": "ぼく、心配しなくても大丈夫だよ！\n練習したら、大きな声が出せるようになるから！", "zh": "我不用担心也没关系哦！\n只要练习，就能发出响亮的声音！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_058_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_058_1047_chiisaiotokonoko", "source_sha256": "8feaedd2a485b4e820be937ef1a5937f0cf964b56b9616fe20d83d1676307cc4", "ja": "ほんと……？", "zh": "真的吗……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_058_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_058_1048_036kan", "source_sha256": "e97f683f523261d063159abc62db8dbc607a564c75e13714699e1ff0587f11ff", "ja": "うん！　たとえば、こんな感じに……小さかったら～♪\nららら～♪　ゆっくり大きく、ドレミファソラ～♪", "zh": "嗯！比如，要是像这样……比较小的话～♪\n啦啦啦～♪慢慢变大，哆来咪发唆啦～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_058_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_058_1049_chiisaiotokonoko", "source_sha256": "b06b87b463bf00c733fb2235c8fd56e2491b2232d88f8262ec6873f7313a8c66", "ja": "くすくす……。\nおねえちゃん、おうたへたっぴだね！", "zh": "嘻嘻……。\n姐姐，你唱歌好笨拙哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_058_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_058_1050_036kan", "source_sha256": "b34e1c17fe3f0446ee92db6c9909baabf769eb4c6d1ce2152f7f1274d8f4b361", "ja": "うっ……へ、へたっぴでもいいの！\nぼく、お歌はキライ？", "zh": "呜……就算唱得不好也没关系！小朋友，你不喜欢唱歌吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_058_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_058_1051_chiisaiotokonoko", "source_sha256": "78366ac07788137293912217d5efefe7a326be8843d482f2de5bf131fd699d36", "ja": "ううん、すき……。", "zh": "没有，喜欢……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_058_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_058_1052_036kan", "source_sha256": "93797e93b550b336cf3c1c8ef5a6947ec1c05a17f7fbc9dfb711da180378cbbd", "ja": "それなら、私と同じだね！　よかった♪\nじゃあ、私と一緒に歌ってみない？", "zh": "那就和我一样啦！太好了♪\n那么，要不要和我一起唱唱看？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_058_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_058_1053_036kan", "source_sha256": "ee94733adda741be3ffb51b5c38b2050c074194ee8a4c39e2a97131d26cf5d7f", "ja": "それに、ひとりだと難しくても、みんなとなら\n恥ずかしくないでしょ？", "zh": "而且，就算一个人很难做到，和大家一起就不会害羞了吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_058_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_058_1054_022ser", "source_sha256": "55bc8afd80a10b21573f8c3ceedc6045dcd7608fec5c231238d4dc61a74a792b", "ja": "そうですね！\nぼく、わたしたちと一緒に歌ってみようか？", "zh": "没错！\n你要不要试着和我们一起唱呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_058_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_058_1055_029umi", "source_sha256": "aec539b469a0c08a4ea30c25f4255ab09c42ddc1007099aa3fee8783168f18fa", "ja": "いい？　大きい声を出したい時は、\nお腹に力を込めるんだよ？　せーのっ！", "zh": "听好了哦？想要大声喊出来的时候，\n肚子要用上力气哦？预备——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_058_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_058_1057_p", "source_sha256": "8733a2dee9009470bc7450f22d9210bce55a85a438dd6d7886832db58e92626a", "ja": "（劇場外での合唱会は、夕方まで続いてしまった。\nでも、そのおかげか……）", "zh": "（剧场外的合唱会一直持续到了傍晚。不过，也正因为这样……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_058_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_058_1058_chiisaiotokonoko", "source_sha256": "319790e6979ad88e917321a76ee820222d6dad32291583f92d78b8c33f678775", "ja": "ありがとう、おねえちゃんたち！\nぼく、こんどはおおきなこえ、だせるとおもう……。", "zh": "谢谢大姐姐们！\n我想我下次能大声喊出来了……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_058_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_058_1059_chiisaiotokonoko", "source_sha256": "5f93f35de7969a86e1c28fab4a4ed4c35f672a0fc414cdaa9e5299bdb31fc7d0", "ja": "またね！　ばいばーい！", "zh": "下次见！拜拜～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_058_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_058_1060_036kan", "source_sha256": "e3c33eeecbc73c6447c27c4d9d143585ddd5e8f286c4c91b6ef0d753be8fa5a0", "ja": "ばいばーい！　歌の練習、がんばってねー！\nひとりでさみしかったら、また一緒に練習しようねー！", "zh": "拜拜！要加油练歌哦——！\n要是一个人觉得寂寞的话，下次再一起练习吧——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_058_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_058_1061_p", "source_sha256": "cfd59aada9a7dc2588114108c47756feb1170ee1c95e810ce4f091d1a64fdb0c", "ja": "あの子、すっかり元気になったみたいだ。\n偉かったな、可奈。", "zh": "那孩子好像已经完全打起精神来了。\n真了不起，可奈。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_058_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_058_1062_036kan", "source_sha256": "f5dea3d198436aee0b86daa928614125e42cbebb7964f35f8e3ce0645354f14d", "ja": "うう……\n{$P$}さぁん……ううっ。", "zh": "呜呜……\n{$P$}先生……呜呜。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_058_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_058_1063_p", "source_sha256": "39e3dc2fdf0adc584c078d4f49b36f78bd498b02457b57fd5806b71e7ac09c4f", "ja": "え？　可奈、どうしたんだ？", "zh": "咦？可奈，你怎么了？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_058_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_058_1064_036kan", "source_sha256": "5e7821be609f9346dde92d55d796b0f091d5b065cf223199a610cd0425b23c16", "ja": "わ、私の歌……。\nへたっぴって言われちゃいました……うう……。", "zh": "我、我的歌……\n被说成唱得很差……呜呜……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_058_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_058_1065_033sih", "source_sha256": "7ed805c14bf244ae0c59ef3f15b8acf9e3aa01c83c786d0e4cd8bd070237a6df", "ja": "あの子の言葉、気にしてたの？\nそれなのに強がっちゃって……あきれた。", "zh": "你很在意那个孩子说的话吗？\n明明是这样还硬要逞强……真拿你没办法。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_058_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_058_1066_036kan", "source_sha256": "2052cd5f1655494969fa6f7fe3b5fb1154dcf1974830916e249649543d027db6", "ja": "だ、だって～……泣いてる小さい子の前で、\n落ち込んでるとこなんて見せられないから……。", "zh": "可、可是～……在哭泣的小孩子面前，\n怎么能让她看到我消沉的样子……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_058_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_058_1067_036kan", "source_sha256": "2753040cffb4847aa624924ac9cb27f8e32225ec9748da0752bb5bc53f8f99f3", "ja": "私、ちっとも歌がうまくなってないんだぁ……。\nうう、あらためて言われると、ショック……。", "zh": "我，歌一点都没有进步呢……。\n呜呜，被这么直接说出来，好受打击……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_058_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_058_1069_022ser", "source_sha256": "83fe8d36d77bbf1dc2d060ff8cf0c8d3ed40ccd895f1fd21a138615e437a3b10", "ja": "あの、前から気になってたんですけど。\n可奈さんは、どうしてそんなに歌が好きなんですか？", "zh": "那个，我从以前就有点好奇了。\n可奈小姐为什么会这么喜欢唱歌呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_058_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_058_1070_p", "source_sha256": "e382eea160137ebfdf608fc65ad625ae2f8c2dabce106e38881cd54533014630", "ja": "そういえば……。可奈にとって歌は特別だけど、\n理由は聞いた事がなかったな。", "zh": "说起来……对可奈而言，歌是特别的存在，\n但我还从没问过理由呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_058_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_058_1071_027say", "source_sha256": "a409292f12fe64b4c1f2d2bbb790f1aa24e1aa3e35befc13b981082e44002300", "ja": "可奈ちゃんの歌への情熱の理由、聞いてみたいな。\nあ！　もし言いにくいことだったら、無理には……。", "zh": "我想听听可奈对歌唱如此热情的原因呢。\n啊！如果是不太好说的事，就不用勉强……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_058_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_058_1072_036kan", "source_sha256": "185f7429d7761530ded7353923f703c806a33e9d494fbac8ecb3ae2d0bd3e9a8", "ja": "いえ全然！　そんな、ビックリするような、\nすごい理由とか全然なくって……えっと……。", "zh": "完全不会！也没有什么让人吃惊的、特别了不起的理由……那个……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_058_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_058_1073_036kan", "source_sha256": "5b79c565f0a6bf4079c4c2d385941c684f44f58fde7445cc2ed6f6086c423088", "ja": "自分でも、どうしてかはよくわからないんですけど。\n小さい時から、ずっと好きだったんです！", "zh": "连我自己也不太清楚为什么。\n从小就一直喜欢着！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_058_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_058_1074_036kan", "source_sha256": "6a11b283640ddde70f3caabf20ea0f7ea4ca4b45e175165875544c6d5b5f7b82", "ja": "私が小さいころ、何でかは忘れちゃったんですけど……\n泣いてたら、誰かが歌を歌って励ましてくれたんです。", "zh": "我小时候，具体原因已经忘了……\n哭着哭着，有人唱起歌来鼓励我。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_058_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_058_1075_036kan", "source_sha256": "4b1db8a4dc1fa4a0757bd9f00a156e061bc0faae24cfac9377a64c04c471d8b8", "ja": "それで、一緒に歌おうって。「大きな声で歌うと、\n笑ってるみたいでしょ？」って。誰かに……。", "zh": "然后，有人对我说，一起唱吧。“大声唱歌的话，就像是在笑，对吧？”……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_058_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_058_1077_036kan", "source_sha256": "0b07565386a11997a838dfdb8c210fff13c2af9abafc27a902c26893a59bd7ea", "ja": "それに、大きな声で歌を歌ってると、\nなんだか元気な気分になりませんか？　ら～らら～♪", "zh": "而且，大声唱歌的时候，不知怎么就会让人觉得精神起来了，不是吗？啦～啦啦～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_058_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_058_1078_027say", "source_sha256": "c71905ba9c057c40d4375e400924fe0263abec2d32f93dc2e6e5e6cb7476a3e3", "ja": "それなら、私もわかるよ！　大事な発表の前とか、\n弱気な時には、大きな声出して気合い入れるもん！", "zh": "那样的话，我也懂！在进行重要发表前，或者感到泄气的时候，我都会大声喊出来给自己打气！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_058_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_058_1079_036kan", "source_sha256": "70cc12125e2dfc4db0051a02da6032affbcaa35c245e99e439ea8463dbcb47bd", "ja": "えへへ、そうですよね？\n大きな声を出すと、なんか元気が出てくるんです！", "zh": "嘿嘿，是吧？\n大声喊出来，就会感觉浑身都有精神了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_058_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_058_1080_036kan", "source_sha256": "7e4a8ebf0bc485cd0581394e9237de9db8dcc44c7badc9db1641acbf11127f07", "ja": "だから、歌は、もちろん大好きだけど……大きな声で\n歌うのは、元気になるおまじない、みたいなものかも？", "zh": "所以，我当然很喜欢唱歌，但是……大声\n唱歌或许就像是让自己打起精神的魔法吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_058_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_058_1081_p", "source_sha256": "31ddde36e9c88812e5cbf1a76f98544bb8e99bead0c1e76b3cabef883a7dfa0e", "ja": "歌は、元気になるおまじない、か。\n……うん、いいじゃないか。可奈らしいと思うよ。", "zh": "唱歌是让人打起精神的咒语吗？\n……嗯，这不是挺好的吗？我觉得很有可奈的风格。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_058_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_058_1082_022ser", "source_sha256": "8e3bd7eea871a36eb3ccf51bffaba95ca6b84a062859f0e239af69b6eb998f10", "ja": "はい、とってもステキなお話ですね！　それに、\n歌に勇気づけられる気持ち、わたしにもわかります！", "zh": "是的，这是个非常美好的故事呢！而且，我也能理解被歌声鼓舞的心情！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_058_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_058_1083_029umi", "source_sha256": "4ad5fea5556a4665f1a926bdb6012bf1bcaa2ffa231e9b62089458a1bc0e9ed9", "ja": "そっかぁ……そういう気持ちがこめられてるから、\nかなりんの歌を聴くと、楽しくなるんだね！", "zh": "这样啊……正因为歌曲中寄托着这样的心情，听到可奈的歌就会变得开心呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_058_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_058_1084_033sih", "source_sha256": "3c1a2ade3e8aade5273043d3a6aa70126a256092fd96d76d4d8ca8508c245f72", "ja": "そうですね。\nまだまだ、練習は必要みたいですけど。", "zh": "是啊。\n虽然看来还需要继续练习。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_058_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_058_1085_036kan", "source_sha256": "bb332b94453e1ac95da640e7dc2cab03a1d70f9c5b5b3cbb9bdb27abdef501f2", "ja": "ううっ……へ、ヘタでも、めげないあきらめない～♪\n練習あるのみ～♪", "zh": "呜呜……就、就算唱得不好，也不能气馁，不能放弃～♪\n只能好好练习～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_058_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_058_1086_036kan", "source_sha256": "cd989e089cb343cd48e2657462f0bcdb0e554b23a7a2b998f210a4e459c62d84", "ja": "でも、私が新しい曲、もらっちゃったけど……\nほんとに私で、よかったのかな～……？", "zh": "但是，虽然我拿到了新歌……\n真的由我来唱，没问题吗～……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_058_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_058_1087_p", "source_sha256": "59fe2accb47fe979ded4939ea2740a232a14c2b542d32552b4ca1f4fe31ae113", "ja": "可奈は立派な劇場のアイドルだよ。これまでだって、\n可奈の歌を褒めてくれた人は、たくさんいただろ？", "zh": "可奈已经是剧场里很优秀的偶像了。而且在这之前，\n也有很多人夸奖过可奈的歌声吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_058_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_058_1088_036kan", "source_sha256": "ccc3b314c2585f3bc863d61ebd18414e7a1802adc9d3ebba28023774d1f31705", "ja": "{$P$}さん……\nうう、それはそうなんですけど……。", "zh": "{$P$}先生……\n唔，这倒是没错，可是……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_058_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_058_1089_022ser", "source_sha256": "c7ff9846db729c743aadba71a3f0acab68d54596a91480262ef22c7f2267ba7b", "ja": "可奈さんの歌、わたしは大好きです！\n聴いていると、心がとっても温かくなります！", "zh": "我最喜欢可奈姐姐的歌了！\n听着她的歌，心里会变得特别温暖！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_058_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_058_1090_029umi", "source_sha256": "6b8c12b08fe468671a5acb0c9ac8927aaa69e9e42ce1acc0ca54356dbe232be4", "ja": "私も！　私も、かなりんの歌、好きだよ！", "zh": "我也是！我也很喜欢可奈的歌！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_058_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_058_1091_027say", "source_sha256": "7eb98be52e5fb9c7d8a2a17593bf79d2c4db65e26abc9547227a7f1e49d44102", "ja": "そうだね。可奈ちゃんの歌は、一緒に歌いたくなるって\nいうか……周りの人を、巻き込む力があると思う！", "zh": "对呀。可奈的歌，总让人忍不住想一起唱……该说是有种能把周围的人都带动起来的力量吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_058_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_058_1092_036kan", "source_sha256": "4e6d6fa35a73865443395e30078c950445009b7f4d112a3da609d1a8e01e06fd", "ja": "うぅ……みんな、{$P$}さん……\nありがとう……。", "zh": "呜呜……大家，{$P$}先生……\n谢谢你们……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_058_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_058_1093_036kan", "source_sha256": "b4a6c7ad7dae10aaa136834a6f1a29f1c99c21427fb1dfd08a6cc0d8637e96ba", "ja": "あの、志保ちゃん。\n志保ちゃんは、その、えっと……。", "zh": "那个，志保。\n志保你……那个，呃……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_058_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_058_1094_033sih", "source_sha256": "f2516bf6b7ccb9f1f4a14bb6da2684a82ca8bba97c81b25b10454adfca21edb2", "ja": "なに、その間は。こっちを見ないで。", "zh": "怎么突然停顿了？别看我。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_058_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_058_1095_036kan", "source_sha256": "a2c8bf44596a85bb8917e0381a145ca49a1633bca88a3ab8e37d153c725c1fe9", "ja": "え～……。", "zh": "诶——……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_058_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_058_1096_033sih", "source_sha256": "67e7eaa5f7e0111d25f7c8c3578a41a5d6505fc2188ef1d966cd14fecbbd617e", "ja": "私は可奈の歌、上手いとは思わないわ。\nでも、そうね。……たしかに、嫌いじゃないかも。", "zh": "我不觉得可奈唱歌很好听。\n不过，也是呢……我确实可能并不讨厌。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_058_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_058_1097_036kan", "source_sha256": "8a9ea06682dd1f886eb821d0c13c4c46f5b768835ef3763c8584938d9fd090ed", "ja": "志保ちゃん……！", "zh": "志保……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_058_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_058_1098_p", "source_sha256": "066429fbadc8e28de78285837b93e211bb16929b9642e9b4429d4a2b2405fae7", "ja": "そうだな。可奈の歌は、上手下手関係なく心に残る。\nみんな、そう言いたいんじゃないのかな。", "zh": "是啊。可奈的歌声，不管唱得好不好，都会留在心里。\n大家想说的，应该就是这个吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_058_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_058_1099_p", "source_sha256": "3e16482235d629c1f14f64399419702c7a342e5064eb305bb4074bd792c11436", "ja": "それは、可奈だけが持つ歌の力なんじゃないか？", "zh": "那不正是只有可奈才拥有的歌声力量吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_058_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_058_1100_036kan", "source_sha256": "dd05b5b145623272164406ae83650c633c85e717c29382a78fd31bcb4f1cd198", "ja": "私だけが持つ、歌の力……ですか？", "zh": "只有我才拥有的、歌声的力量……吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_058_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_058_1101_p", "source_sha256": "79abed922790631dc379fcd7c73d8cc7d544039433fae3e9b6b9906cd1611af4", "ja": "うん。そんな可奈だからこそ、歌でみんなに\nおまじないをかけてあげられる……そう思うんだ。", "zh": "嗯。正因为是这样的可奈，才能够用歌声\n为大家施展魔法……我是这么觉得的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_058_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_058_1102_036kan", "source_sha256": "a443728a8175b991932eba7c1377a7feb90b5c05a89ee687339a5281a0ed75e9", "ja": "{$P$}さん……。", "zh": "{$P$}先生……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_058_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_058_1103_036kan", "source_sha256": "60be39dfa0cf725ed61de59b132d08346506edabcd43594869802c7d85c85073", "ja": "わ、わかりましたぁ！　私、この歌で、みんなが\n元気になるような、おまじないをかけてあげたいです！", "zh": "我、我明白啦！我想用这首歌，为大家施展能\n让人打起精神来的魔法！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_058_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_058_1104_036kan", "source_sha256": "30e4ab1c61c3e4194c08a116c16634a6d586b625e8ad9fa92e23ae994e007ac0", "ja": "よーし、レッスンがんばろー！　あっ、でもでも、\nどうせなら歌は、上手なほうがいいですよね……？", "zh": "好——要努力练习啦！啊，不过不过，\n既然如此，歌还是唱得更好一些比较好吧……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_058_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_058_1105_p", "source_sha256": "3ee8c70d54788668a7aa19a65cd2e53ea5cfdcfbcceedab1f0ca60d81b9dcd5c", "ja": "もちろん、そうだな。\nだから公演まで、レッスンを頑張ろう！", "zh": "当然，没错。  \n所以在演出前，努力练习吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_058_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_058_1106_033sih", "source_sha256": "3d3f237323d6ad483220c6c814b24cc3356ee71f4007404b9a05913529d24784", "ja": "{$P$}さんの言うとおりね。\n今日から公演まで、死ぬほどがんばりなさい。", "zh": "确实如{$P$}先生所说。\n从今天开始到公演为止，给我拼命努力。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_058_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_058_1107_036kan", "source_sha256": "18c1fae6209e6f1805b63f7214e6bc4014af5088e89fecf5d6485f261e3e95ae", "ja": "ふぁい……。やっぱり、志保ちゃんは厳しい～♪\nだけど、かけてみせるぞおまじない～♪", "zh": "好——♪果然志保还是很严格呢～♪\n不过，我一定要施展这个魔法给你看——♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_058_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_058_1108_p", "source_sha256": "7db7127e7c6e0014a16a22dd1ed643b3f2a04ddcad82483b39ba58ca78e57cc7", "ja": "（可奈の歌は、人を笑顔にするおまじない……\nその力は、ステージの上で一番発揮されるはずだ！）", "zh": "（可奈的歌，是能让人露出笑容的魔法……这份力量，应该能在舞台上发挥到最大！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
